BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Wedding Banquet
DTSTART:20250624T010000Z
DTEND:20250624T031000Z
DTSTAMP:20250624T010000Z
UID:KZR4IXxtyj
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 107 mins (1h47m)\n\nPresented by 旦夕书店 AMOMEN
 T BOOKS. 片為李安第二部長片，以華人家族倫理角度切入
 同性情感，成功在國際影壇嶄露頭角。 This is Ang Lee's seco
 nd film\, offering a unique exploration of same-sex relationships through 
 the lens of Confucian cultural values\, gaining significant recognition on
  the global stage.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/the-wedding-
 banquet
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
